<title>UK: Severn Trent to complete share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Severn Trent to complete share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British water and sewage company Severn Trent Plc said on Thursday it proposed measures to complete its previously-announced plan to buy back up to 10 percent of its share capital.</p>
<p>The proposals would include a capital reorganisation enabling shareholders to receive cash under the plan.</p>
<p>Severn Trent unveiled the buyback plan in November.</p>
<p>The company said it would seek shareholder approval of the plan at its annual meeting, scheduled for July 30. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
